---
/**
 * AI in the ticket: the customer writes in German, the agent reads English,
 * a summary sits on top, and a draft streams in, in the customer's language.
 * The answer bot card shows the same knowledge answering in the widget.
 */
import Stage from '../Stage.astro';
import Icon from '../Icon.astro';
import Avatar from '../mock/Avatar.astro';
---
<Stage w={760} h={500} mobileW={492} mobileX={0} label="An opendesk ticket with a translated message, an AI summary and an AI drafted reply in German.">
  <div class="app-window left-[32px] top-[32px] w-[444px] h-[500px]" data-seq data-hold="4400">
    <div class="flex items-center gap-2 border-b border-line px-4 py-3">
      <span class="font-mono text-[11px] text-subtle">#1058</span>
      <span class="text-[13px] font-semibold text-fg">Rechnung doppelt abgebucht</span>
      <span class="pill t-violet ml-auto font-mono"><Icon name="globe" size={10} />DE → EN</span>
    </div>
    <div class="space-y-3 p-4">
      <article class="flex gap-2.5">
        <Avatar initials="FB" size={26} />
        <div class="min-w-0">
          <div class="text-[12px] font-semibold text-fg">Felix Braun <span class="font-normal text-subtle">translated from German</span></div>
          <p class="mt-1 text-[12.5px] leading-[1.55] text-fg/85">I was charged twice for October. Can you refund the second payment? This is the second time this has happened.</p>
        </div>
      </article>
      <div class="s-up rounded-[6px] border border-line p-3" data-step="1" data-wait="900">
        <div class="flex items-center gap-1.5 font-mono text-[10px] uppercase tracking-[0.08em]"><span class="t-violet tint inline-flex items-center gap-1.5"><Icon name="sparkles" size={11} />Summary</span><span class="pill pill-dot t-amber ml-auto normal-case tracking-normal font-sans">Frustrated</span></div>
        <ul class="mt-2 space-y-1 text-[12px] text-fg/85">
          <li class="flex gap-2"><span class="mt-[7px] size-1 shrink-0 rounded-full bg-fg"></span>Duplicate October charge, wants a refund</li>
          <li class="flex gap-2"><span class="mt-[7px] size-1 shrink-0 rounded-full bg-fg"></span>Second time, see #934</li>
        </ul>
        <div class="mt-2.5 flex gap-1.5"><span class="pill t-teal">billing</span><span class="pill t-pink">refund</span><span class="pill pill-dot t-orange">High</span></div>
      </div>
      <div class="s-up t-violet ring-t rounded-[8px] p-3" style="background:color-mix(in oklab, var(--c-violet) 4%, var(--raised))" data-step="2" data-wait="900">
        <div class="flex items-center gap-1.5 text-[11.5px]"><Icon name="sparkles" size={12} class="tint" /><span class="font-medium tint">Draft</span><span class="text-subtle">in your voice, in German</span><span class="ml-auto font-mono text-[10px] text-subtle">3 credits</span></div>
        <p class="mt-2 min-h-[58px] text-[12.5px] leading-[1.55] text-fg" data-stream="40">Hallo Felix, das tut mir leid. Ich habe die doppelte Zahlung erstattet, sie ist in 5 Werktagen auf Ihrem Konto.</p>
        <div class="mt-2.5 flex items-center gap-1.5">
          {['Shorter', 'Friendlier', 'English'].map((t) => <span class="rounded-[5px] px-2 py-1 text-[11px] text-muted ring-1 ring-line">{t}</span>)}
          <span class="ml-auto rounded-[5px] bg-fg px-2.5 py-1 text-[11px] font-medium text-bg">Use draft</span>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>

  <div class="float-card left-[496px] top-[96px] w-[236px]" data-seq data-hold="4400">
    <div class="flex items-center gap-2 border-b border-line px-3.5 py-2.5">
      <span class="text-[12px] font-semibold text-fg">Northwind</span>
      <span class="pill t-grey ml-auto font-mono">ES</span>
    </div>
    <div class="space-y-2 p-3 text-[11.5px] leading-[1.45]">
      <div class="t-blue fill-t ml-auto w-fit rounded-[6px] rounded-br-[3px] px-2.5 py-1.5 text-white">¿Cómo exporto mis facturas?</div>
      <div class="s-up rounded-[6px] rounded-bl-[3px] bg-surface px-2.5 py-2 text-fg" data-step="1" data-wait="1600">
        <div class="t-violet tint mb-1 flex items-center gap-1 font-mono text-[9px] uppercase tracking-[0.08em]"><Icon name="sparkles" size={9} />AI answer</div>
        Ve a Facturas, filtra por mes y pulsa Exportar CSV.
        <div class="mt-1.5 flex items-center gap-1.5 rounded-[6px] bg-bg px-2 py-1 text-[10.5px] text-muted ring-1 ring-line"><Icon name="fileText" size={10} />Export invoices as CSV</div>
      </div>
      <div class="s-fade flex gap-1.5" data-step="2" data-wait="800"><span class="rounded-[5px] px-2 py-1 text-[10.5px] text-muted ring-1 ring-line">That helped</span><span class="t-blue fill-t rounded-[5px] px-2 py-1 text-[10.5px] text-white">Talk to a person</span></div>
    </div>
  </div>
</Stage>
